sequenceDiagram
  actor Donateur
  participant Web as Web/Mobile App
  participant API as Backend API
  participant DB as Base de donnees
  participant Pay as Service Paiement
  actor Association
  actor Livreur

  Donateur->>Web: Choisir besoin et montant
  Web->>API: POST /checkout
  API->>DB: Creer DonationOrder (pending)
  API-->>Web: orderId + paymentIntent

  Web->>Pay: Confirmer paiement
  Pay-->>API: Webhook paiement_succeeded
  API->>DB: MAJ PaymentTransaction = succeeded
  API->>DB: MAJ DonationOrder = paid
  API-->>Web: Paiement confirme

  Association->>API: POST /missions (orderId)
  API->>DB: Creer DeliveryMission (pending)
  API-->>Association: Mission creee

  Livreur->>API: POST /missions/:id/accept
  API->>DB: MAJ mission = accepted
  API-->>Association: Livreur assigne

  Livreur->>API: POST /missions/:id/proof
  API->>DB: Enregistrer preuve
  Livreur->>API: PATCH /missions/:id/status delivered
  API->>DB: MAJ mission = delivered
  API-->>Association: Livraison terminee

  Association->>API: PATCH /missions/:id/status confirmed
  API->>DB: MAJ mission = confirmed
  API-->>Donateur: Don livre et confirme